WEBVTT

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.680
This scientist from 
Indian Space Research Organisation

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.940
is proving on a daily basis 
through her work

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.900
that India is in the forefront 


00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.030
when it comes to leading 
the world to the future.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.480
On TED Talks India,
Nayi Soch,

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:44.230
please welcome Ritu Karidhal Srivastava,

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:49.090
one of the few chosen women 
to be called the rocket women of India.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.550
Ritu Karidhal Srivastava.

00:00:51.655 --> 00:00:57.055
(Applause)